1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 23]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:02:01,110 --> 00:02:02,140
Xumi Realm?

14
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,100
[Xumi Realm]

15
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:17,500
[Xumi Realm]

16
00:02:33,830 --> 00:02:34,500
Could this

17
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,850
be a morning glory seed?

18
00:03:28,830 --> 00:03:30,180
"Ding Qiansui colluded with the Japanese.

19
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,900
The jar is the core of the magic.

20
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:34,810
It will bring mortal danger.

21
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:38,810
Go deeper. I'll be waiting.

22
00:03:39,830 --> 00:03:40,690
The seed is important.

23
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,860
You must trust yourself."

24
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,220
Am I supposed to grow this seed?

25
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,210
Master.

26
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,940
It's solid rock behind this wall.

27
00:05:07,350 --> 00:05:08,180
There's no passage.

28
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,940
This place ends here.

29
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:14,620
They say fish water nourishes, and rice water makes things thrive.

30
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:17,010
Could we be using the wrong water?

31
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,980
That makes sense.

32
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,500
But Laogou,

33
00:05:20,910 --> 00:05:22,330
that's for growing crops.

34
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,250
We're growing a tower here.

35
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,570
It's different.

36
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,370
Then what kind

37
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:30,330
of water do we need?

38
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,370
Tiezui.

39
00:05:36,150 --> 00:05:36,740
Give me your hand.

40
00:05:38,230 --> 00:05:38,660
What for?

41
00:05:42,230 --> 00:05:43,740
That hurts, Laogou!

42
00:05:46,470 --> 00:05:47,450
Are you mad?

43
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,130
Let's try it.

44
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,810
That's how it always goes in stories.

45
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,370
Good heavens.

46
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:00,460
[Otherworld Tower]

47
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,130
We really

48
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,500
grew a tower.

49
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,570
Told you miracles happen.

50
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,330
Not a speck of dust.

51
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,330
Could a visual trick be this convincing?

52
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,850
It looks freshly built.

53
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:51,450
It just grew.

54
00:08:52,110 --> 00:08:52,970
Of course it's new.

55
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,940
Good thing you brought me down here.

56
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:56,420
Otherwise, this tower

57
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,330
might never have been grown.

58
00:09:01,990 --> 00:09:02,610
Zhang Qishan,

59
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:04,380
do you believe me now?

60
00:09:04,990 --> 00:09:05,540
Fine.

61
00:09:06,350 --> 00:09:07,450
We'll say you were right.

62
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:09,380
Master Zhang.

63
00:09:24,470 --> 00:09:25,140
You all heard that?

64
00:09:26,590 --> 00:09:27,140
Yes.

65
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:28,810
Do you think

66
00:09:29,350 --> 00:09:30,420
the tower might be

67
00:09:30,470 --> 00:09:31,490
shrinking back?

68
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:33,210
Then we'd better run.

69
00:09:33,470 --> 00:09:34,140
Otherwise,

70
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:35,660
we'll be crushed to death.

71
00:09:56,350 --> 00:09:56,730
Master Zhang,

72
00:09:57,470 --> 00:09:58,420
there's space behind this wall.

73
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:36,810
Master Zhang.

74
00:10:38,630 --> 00:10:39,730
Master Zhang, look.

75
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,300
Isn't this the corridor

76
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:48,260
in the great ghost palace

77
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,090
Yin Changsheng built?

78
00:10:50,630 --> 00:10:51,060
But...

79
00:10:52,990 --> 00:10:54,180
But the location is wrong.

80
00:10:54,470 --> 00:10:55,140
The two corridors

81
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:56,380
shouldn't be next to each other.

82
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,090
The tower is still growing.

83
00:11:00,990 --> 00:11:01,490
Xiaoyu,

84
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,090
smash through this wall too.

85
00:11:26,830 --> 00:11:27,420
Master Zhang,

86
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:29,090
why are we back

87
00:11:29,110 --> 00:11:30,060
in the Otherworld Hall?

88
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:30,780
[Otherworld Tower]

89
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,900
This isn't the same place.

90
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:35,210
Right.

91
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:40,090
The incantation on the wall is gone too.

92
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:46,140
Tiezui.

93
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:49,060
Recite that spell

94
00:11:49,830 --> 00:11:50,810
for growing the tower again.

95
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,210
Tower Cultivation:

96
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,420
"Though no path seems to lie ahead,

97
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,540
it simply has yet to be grown.

98
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:58,420
Plant the magical seed.

99
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,060
Let water and fire unite,

100
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,420
and 100 towers shall rise,

101
00:12:03,230 --> 00:12:04,180
with 1,000 gates opening.

102
00:12:04,470 --> 00:12:04,900
The towers

103
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,420
will grow by themselves."

104
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,180
I understand now.

105
00:12:09,350 --> 00:12:10,380
The hundred towers mentioned

106
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:12,260
aren't an exaggeration.

107
00:12:12,590 --> 00:12:13,610
It literally means 100 towers.

108
00:12:16,470 --> 00:12:16,940
We

109
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:19,300
grew 100 towers.

110
00:12:21,460 --> 00:12:26,580
[Otherworld Tower]

111
00:13:43,750 --> 00:13:45,090
Laogou, Tiezui!

112
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:53,330
Master,

113
00:13:54,110 --> 00:13:55,570
doesn't that look like Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

114
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,610
That's Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

115
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:00,660
Who painted this?

116
00:14:01,750 --> 00:14:02,810
Why is it here?

117
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,810
The style is Japanese.

118
00:14:05,710 --> 00:14:07,570
The Japanese must have painted it themselves.

119
00:14:08,510 --> 00:14:09,140
Master Zhang,

120
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,450
there's a reason

121
00:14:11,990 --> 00:14:13,490
this was painted here.

122
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,210
Do you remember

123
00:14:16,710 --> 00:14:17,210
one

124
00:14:17,230 --> 00:14:18,260
of the spells we saw before

125
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,810
called Spirit Communion?

126
00:14:19,810 --> 00:14:23,300
[Spirit Communion]

127
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:25,090
Look.

128
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,140
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's right hand

129
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:28,850
forms the Heavenly Master Seal,

130
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,660
and his left forms the Earth Gate Seal.

131
00:14:31,230 --> 00:14:32,490
Together, they mean to connect

132
00:14:32,870 --> 00:14:33,810
heaven and earth.

133
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,420
That's a gesture for spirit communion.

134
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,210
And this mural

135
00:14:37,350 --> 00:14:38,380
was painted

136
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,490
right at the central Taiji point,

137
00:14:39,830 --> 00:14:41,420
where the entire tower's energy

138
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,970
converges.

139
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:45,140
So this mural

140
00:14:45,630 --> 00:14:47,090
isn't really a mural at all.

141
00:14:47,750 --> 00:14:49,060
It's Hatoyama performing a ritual.

142
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,330
He's using

143
00:14:51,350 --> 00:14:52,780
Spirit Communion to communicate

144
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:54,060
with this tower,

145
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,210
or rather,

146
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:56,490
with whatever

147
00:14:56,510 --> 00:14:57,380
these hundred towers

148
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,090
have grown into.

149
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:04,330
He's communicating with this tower?

150
00:15:05,830 --> 00:15:07,490
Could he be learning spells from it?

151
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,780
There's no point speculating too much now.

152
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:11,660
Catching him is what matters most.

153
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,180
Since Hatoyama left this mural here,

154
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,420
he must have been here.

155
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:18,180
We'll start from here

156
00:15:18,590 --> 00:15:20,060
and follow his trail.

157
00:15:21,470 --> 00:15:22,090
All right.

158
00:15:52,590 --> 00:15:54,300
You finally came.

159
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,660
You left this for me,

160
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:03,380
didn't you?

161
00:16:05,870 --> 00:16:06,900
So you

162
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,330
do believe

163
00:16:08,350 --> 00:16:10,420
the clues I left you.

164
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:17,580
[The jar is the core of the magic. It will bring mortal danger.]

165
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:19,660
You said this jar

166
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:21,020
would bring mortal danger,

167
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,610
so I gave it to Ding Qiansui

168
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:25,610
to see if he'd die.

169
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,900
Now that Ding Qiansui is dead,

170
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:35,970
that means

171
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:38,060
there's some truth

172
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,450
to this note.

173
00:16:40,830 --> 00:16:41,900
Good girl.

174
00:16:42,710 --> 00:16:43,330
Look.

175
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,540
By following the clues I left you,

176
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,140
you managed

177
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,850
to grow this tower, didn't you?

178
00:16:57,990 --> 00:16:58,940
This isn't the truth.

179
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:01,210
Come.

180
00:17:03,590 --> 00:17:05,050
Go deeper.

181
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,940
I'll be waiting.

182
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:11,940
Why did you

183
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:12,900
lead me here?

184
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:14,900
I want you

185
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:18,900
to remember everything.

186
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:27,880
[Go deeper. I'll be waiting.]

187
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,460
[You must trust yourself.]

188
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:20,450
Master,

189
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:21,690
it seems the Japanese

190
00:18:21,710 --> 00:18:22,490
really were here.

191
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,380
Master.

192
00:18:48,510 --> 00:18:48,970
Master,

193
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:50,970
another crossfire position.

194
00:18:52,070 --> 00:18:52,900
What's that smell?

195
00:18:53,310 --> 00:18:54,010
It reeks

196
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,730
of corpses.

197
00:19:00,750 --> 00:19:01,180
Xiaoyu,

198
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:02,690
come in with me.

199
00:19:03,310 --> 00:19:03,820
You two

200
00:19:04,710 --> 00:19:05,210
stay here.

201
00:19:07,070 --> 00:19:08,250
Tiezui and I stay here?

202
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:14,420
Fine.

203
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:15,620
Be careful.

204
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:23,290
Search over there.

205
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:03,530
Master,

206
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:05,690
why are there so many Zhainiangniang?

207
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:07,860
They smell so bad.

208
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:09,660
Can you smell it?

209
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:15,340
I...

210
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,100
They're from Unit 401.

211
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:35,900
Stop.

212
00:20:39,310 --> 00:20:40,420
Something's wrong up ahead.

213
00:20:53,750 --> 00:20:54,860
There are only two possibilities.

214
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:56,340
One,

215
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,050
the fog is poisonous.

216
00:20:59,710 --> 00:21:00,100
Two,

217
00:21:02,550 --> 00:21:04,140
where they lie is extremely dangerous.

218
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,380
Going over there could get us killed.

219
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:09,440
The Japanese always make a point

220
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,600
of laying their war dead to rest.

221
00:21:11,230 --> 00:21:12,470
With so many Japanese soldiers

222
00:21:12,470 --> 00:21:13,210
lying here,

223
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:15,250
there's only one reason

224
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:17,100
their bodies weren't recovered:

225
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:22,050
they couldn't recover them.

226
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:53,900
Tiezui!

227
00:21:55,510 --> 00:21:56,010
Tiezui!

228
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:01,420
Hurry up.

229
00:22:02,790 --> 00:22:03,210
Read this.

230
00:22:03,990 --> 00:22:04,660
What does it say?

231
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:05,820
Read what?

232
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:06,860
Now you need me?

233
00:22:06,890 --> 00:22:07,860
Come on, hurry.

234
00:22:12,550 --> 00:22:13,660
It's all in Japanese.

235
00:22:13,660 --> 00:22:14,730
How am I supposed to read it?

236
00:22:15,360 --> 00:22:16,380
If we'd known,

237
00:22:16,550 --> 00:22:17,180
we should've had

238
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,140
Master Zhang bring Xiaojin down.

239
00:22:20,750 --> 00:22:21,770
Now look at us.

240
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:23,050
The four of us

241
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,290
can't read a single word

242
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:25,250
of this Japanese.

243
00:22:25,510 --> 00:22:26,180
Just take a look.

244
00:22:28,180 --> 00:22:29,500
[Zhang Jiale, Zhang Lifu, Zhang Shun, Zhang Zufeng, Zhang Xiaolei]

245
00:22:30,310 --> 00:22:31,690
Names from Unit 401?

246
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,010
Strange.

247
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:39,860
But why

248
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:41,730
are all these names circled?

249
00:22:42,550 --> 00:22:43,210
What?

250
00:22:45,580 --> 00:22:47,700
[Zhang Jing, Gou, Zhang Kun]

251
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:49,770
Gou?

252
00:22:51,380 --> 00:22:53,100
[Gou]

253
00:22:53,710 --> 00:22:55,290
Why does this drawing

254
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,580
look so familiar?

255
00:22:57,750 --> 00:22:59,450
Why do I feel like I drew it?

256
00:22:59,750 --> 00:23:01,250
Because you did draw it.

257
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:02,660
Who else could it be?

258
00:23:03,070 --> 00:23:04,050
Who signs their name

259
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:05,180
like that?

260
00:23:08,790 --> 00:23:09,690
I can't remember.

261
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,730
If you wrote this "Gou,"

262
00:23:14,030 --> 00:23:15,290
could the names before it have been

263
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:17,380
written by Unit 401 soldiers themselves?

264
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,900
Why are there no more circles

265
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:24,620
after this "Gou" character?

266
00:23:25,470 --> 00:23:25,970
And

267
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,140
look.

268
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:29,210
Only your "Gou"

269
00:23:29,840 --> 00:23:30,940
keeps appearing.

270
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:33,140
The other names show up only now and then.

271
00:23:34,750 --> 00:23:35,290
Could

272
00:23:36,310 --> 00:23:37,500
your signature have

273
00:23:37,500 --> 00:23:38,530
some special meaning?

274
00:23:39,360 --> 00:23:40,290
Think carefully.

275
00:23:43,550 --> 00:23:44,380
I can't remember.

276
00:23:45,030 --> 00:23:46,310
Try harder.

277
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,210
Look. Your signature

278
00:23:47,840 --> 00:23:48,770
is all over this.

279
00:23:49,940 --> 00:23:51,200
[Gou]

280
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:51,940
Remember now?

281
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:54,010
Why is my name there?

282
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:56,450
Well...

283
00:23:56,470 --> 00:23:57,660
I really can't remember.

284
00:24:00,470 --> 00:24:00,940
Master Zhang.

285
00:24:01,360 --> 00:24:01,820
How did it go?

286
00:24:02,470 --> 00:24:03,580
We couldn't get past a spot ahead.

287
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:04,620
It was strewn with bodies.

288
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:05,530
Some were Japanese.

289
00:24:05,840 --> 00:24:06,620
Some were from Unit 401.

290
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,340
And it was full of Zhainiangniang.

291
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:11,660
Master Zhang,

292
00:24:12,230 --> 00:24:13,210
we found

293
00:24:13,270 --> 00:24:13,900
this booklet.

294
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:15,050
Inside

295
00:24:16,030 --> 00:24:17,820
are signatures from Laogou and Unit 401.

296
00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:23,340
[Gou]

297
00:24:28,540 --> 00:24:30,940
[Gou]

298
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:34,340
Based on what

299
00:24:34,360 --> 00:24:35,490
Xiaoyu and I found inside,

300
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,340
we should be able to work it out.

301
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:40,380
"The structure ahead is the only passage.

302
00:24:41,070 --> 00:24:42,900
Toxic gas hangs in the central section.

303
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,620
Even with protective suits,

304
00:24:46,990 --> 00:24:48,250
passage may still be impossible."

305
00:24:54,070 --> 00:24:55,340
Our judgment was right.

306
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:00,340
"Zhainiangniang."

307
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:02,380
"The Zhainiangniang contain

308
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,730
a special protein

309
00:25:04,710 --> 00:25:05,620
that neutralizes the poison."

310
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,860
No wonder the Zhainiangniang inside

311
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,690
are still alive.

312
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:11,660
What does that mean?

313
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:15,010
Could it be

314
00:25:16,200 --> 00:25:17,900
that you tamed the Zhainiangniang,

315
00:25:19,310 --> 00:25:21,140
and the Japanese used them

316
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:23,940
to find a way through the toxic gas?

317
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:30,660
Now I understand.

318
00:25:30,790 --> 00:25:31,290
So,

319
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:33,180
before Laogou arrived,

320
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,050
the people

321
00:25:34,070 --> 00:25:35,450
whose names were circled

322
00:25:36,510 --> 00:25:37,860
were probably already dead.

323
00:25:38,710 --> 00:25:39,820
After Laogou arrived,

324
00:25:40,550 --> 00:25:42,250
the names stopped being circled

325
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:43,340
because

326
00:25:44,230 --> 00:25:46,900
he had tamed the Zhainiangniang

327
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,180
and led those people

328
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:50,250
safely through.

329
00:25:53,750 --> 00:25:54,620
You mean

330
00:25:55,750 --> 00:25:56,900
I helped the Japanese?

331
00:25:59,920 --> 00:26:01,100
Yes, that's what I mean.

332
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:04,620
Laogou,

333
00:26:06,360 --> 00:26:07,660
I need you to focus.

334
00:26:08,750 --> 00:26:09,450
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

335
00:26:09,470 --> 00:26:10,820
may have gone deeper inside.

336
00:26:11,360 --> 00:26:12,380
We have to catch up.

337
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:13,770
Only you.

338
00:26:14,990 --> 00:26:16,100
Only you can get us

339
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,210
through that area.

340
00:26:36,230 --> 00:26:36,770
Master Zhang,

341
00:26:36,990 --> 00:26:37,770
how did this place end up

342
00:26:37,840 --> 00:26:38,660
like this?

343
00:26:39,070 --> 00:26:39,820
Can you remember

344
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,100
how you tamed the Zhainiangniang?

345
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,290
Stay still.

346
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,490
Then I have to try something.

347
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:23,290
What?

348
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,660
I'll lure a Zhainiangniang over

349
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:30,180
and see if it jogs your memory.

350
00:27:31,070 --> 00:27:31,770
But everyone

351
00:27:32,230 --> 00:27:33,180
needs to be prepared.

352
00:27:33,990 --> 00:27:34,740
If I can't

353
00:27:34,740 --> 00:27:35,660
subdue it in one move,

354
00:27:36,600 --> 00:27:37,340
I'll alert

355
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:38,490
every Zhainiangniang here.

356
00:27:41,360 --> 00:27:41,900
Xiaoyu,

357
00:27:43,230 --> 00:27:44,250
if things go wrong,

358
00:27:45,710 --> 00:27:46,580
follow my orders

359
00:27:47,070 --> 00:27:48,820
and take Laogou and Tiezui back.

360
00:27:48,990 --> 00:27:49,940
Don't look back no matter what.

361
00:27:50,310 --> 00:27:50,860
Master Zhang...

362
00:27:51,470 --> 00:27:51,940
Yes.

363
00:27:54,470 --> 00:27:55,100
Laogou, come on.

364
00:27:55,550 --> 00:27:56,290
Stand back.

365
00:27:56,710 --> 00:27:57,140
Come on.

366
00:27:57,470 --> 00:27:57,940
Back here.

367
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:59,010
I can't remember.

368
00:28:27,710 --> 00:28:28,250
Laogou,

369
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:29,660
watch carefully.

370
00:28:35,470 --> 00:28:36,690
Fifth Master, try to remember.

371
00:28:38,310 --> 00:28:38,860
That's right.

372
00:28:38,990 --> 00:28:40,660
There's no time. Think!

373
00:28:40,710 --> 00:28:42,010
Can you tame it?

374
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:57,380
Laogou!

375
00:30:43,360 --> 00:30:43,900
It's alive.

376
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:48,580
Be careful.

377
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:49,770
Keep moving.

378
00:31:18,600 --> 00:31:19,730
Japanese military boot prints.

379
00:31:26,510 --> 00:31:27,100
Master Zhang,

380
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:28,680
we should get out

381
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:29,560
of here.

382
00:31:32,550 --> 00:31:33,420
Keep moving.

383
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:35,380
All right.

384
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:48,530
Laogou!

385
00:31:48,840 --> 00:31:49,450
Come on.

386
00:32:00,550 --> 00:32:01,100
Master Zhang,

387
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:02,100
we really should

388
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:03,100
get out of here.

389
00:32:03,600 --> 00:32:04,530
It's too dangerous,

390
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:06,100
especially with Laogou like this.

391
00:32:06,600 --> 00:32:07,140
Master Zhang,

392
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:08,210
don't wait until...

393
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:18,180
Good heavens.

394
00:32:18,640 --> 00:32:19,690
It's enormous.

395
00:32:22,360 --> 00:32:22,940
Master Zhang,

396
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:24,860
that's no ordinary Zhainiangniang.

397
00:32:25,600 --> 00:32:27,420
That's practically their Queen Mother!

398
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:29,900
Keep moving.

399
00:33:52,710 --> 00:33:53,690
Another tower.

400
00:33:55,710 --> 00:33:57,140
The towers really are growing out of order.

401
00:34:04,600 --> 00:34:05,580
Towers within towers,

402
00:34:06,310 --> 00:34:07,530
perils within perils,

403
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:09,700
beyond all mortal measure.

404
00:34:10,550 --> 00:34:11,490
Behind each gate lies no gate.

405
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:12,820
Behind each shadow lies another.

406
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:14,820
That is the truth of this place.

407
00:34:15,670 --> 00:34:17,220
The Otherworld Tower is infinite.

408
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:27,340
Look.

409
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:31,340
Is that a human eye?

410
00:34:32,360 --> 00:34:33,340
Why is it here?

411
00:34:34,360 --> 00:34:35,220
This carving

412
00:34:35,510 --> 00:34:36,730
never appeared

413
00:34:36,730 --> 00:34:37,490
in the Otherworld Tower in Changsha.

414
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:39,740
Everyone, stay on your guard.

415
00:34:40,990 --> 00:34:41,530
All right.

416
00:34:52,240 --> 00:34:52,740
This way.

417
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:11,320
This is just like the entrance

418
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,860
to the stage back in Changsha's Otherworld Tower.

419
00:35:17,990 --> 00:35:18,820
Look at these footprints.

420
00:35:19,550 --> 00:35:20,380
Don't they look

421
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:21,780
like Japanese military boot prints?

422
00:35:23,470 --> 00:35:24,420
The footprints go

423
00:35:24,470 --> 00:35:25,300
in and out repeatedly.

424
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:26,380
Looks like they

425
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:27,380
stayed here for quite a while.

426
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:28,780
Master Zhang,

427
00:35:29,880 --> 00:35:30,530
this place

428
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:32,260
must have been important

429
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:32,970
to the Japanese.

430
00:35:33,470 --> 00:35:34,130
Let's go in.

431
00:35:34,550 --> 00:35:34,970
All right.

432
00:36:04,190 --> 00:36:04,740
What?

433
00:36:05,150 --> 00:36:06,220
Instead of Madam Wang,

434
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:09,050
the Japanese are putting on the show here?

435
00:37:06,660 --> 00:37:07,820
[Pills of eternal youth and immortality]

436
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:09,900
"Pills of eternal youth and immortality"?

437
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:13,780
Tiezui.

438
00:37:14,990 --> 00:37:15,650
This is your field.

439
00:37:15,990 --> 00:37:16,570
Come take a look.

440
00:37:26,960 --> 00:37:27,650
Ritual implements.

441
00:37:30,110 --> 00:37:30,820
Talismans.

442
00:37:32,110 --> 00:37:33,050
Bamboo slips.

443
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:36,860
Master Zhang,

444
00:37:38,470 --> 00:37:39,490
these are spell manuals

445
00:37:39,510 --> 00:37:40,450
left by Yin Changsheng.

446
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:41,420
Hatoyama

447
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,940
actually found this place.

448
00:37:44,510 --> 00:37:45,130
Read the slips.

449
00:37:46,510 --> 00:37:46,970
All right.

450
00:37:54,510 --> 00:37:55,610
"Walk the Dipper steps.

451
00:37:56,990 --> 00:37:58,260
Let Ren and Hai converge.

452
00:37:59,470 --> 00:38:01,090
Combine three qian of cinnabar,

453
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:03,090
one qian of a child's blood,

454
00:38:04,150 --> 00:38:06,130
and half a qian of hanshui deer-antler shavings.

455
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:08,520
Refine until red-gold,

456
00:38:08,590 --> 00:38:09,900
then swallow with warm wine.

457
00:38:10,840 --> 00:38:12,940
Youth will return,

458
00:38:13,280 --> 00:38:14,260
and no poison can harm you."

459
00:38:16,470 --> 00:38:16,970
Master Zhang,

460
00:38:17,320 --> 00:38:17,650
this...

461
00:38:19,070 --> 00:38:20,650
this is the Danqi Revival Art.

462
00:38:30,110 --> 00:38:31,090
"Twenty-nine years old.

463
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:32,130
Male.

464
00:38:32,990 --> 00:38:33,700
Test subject.

465
00:38:34,880 --> 00:38:35,740
Full-body convulsions

466
00:38:36,590 --> 00:38:37,740
after administration.

467
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,970
Body temperature: 52 degrees.

468
00:38:40,590 --> 00:38:41,570
Skin turned bluish-purple.

469
00:38:43,550 --> 00:38:44,380
Showed signs of poisoning.

470
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:47,700
Heartbeat stopped after 16 minutes."

471
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,740
Looks like Hatoyama

472
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:52,610
was

473
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:53,970
conducting experiments

474
00:38:54,670 --> 00:38:55,650
according to the ancient texts.

475
00:38:56,550 --> 00:38:57,090
Could he

476
00:38:57,990 --> 00:38:59,340
be trying to become an immortal?

477
00:39:00,590 --> 00:39:01,300
This isn't cultivation.

478
00:39:01,550 --> 00:39:02,170
It's refining life itself.

479
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:03,740
They're using us as fuel

480
00:39:03,770 --> 00:39:04,570
to prolong their lives.

481
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:10,530
He wasn't just studying spells.

482
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:13,220
He used people as test subjects.

483
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:15,650
A lot of people died.

484
00:39:18,280 --> 00:39:19,010
Come look!

485
00:39:38,720 --> 00:39:39,490
Why are these all

486
00:39:39,510 --> 00:39:40,420
Japanese corpses?

487
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,420
Strange.

488
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:44,820
How did their bodies

489
00:39:45,510 --> 00:39:46,860
end up like this?

490
00:40:13,190 --> 00:40:15,940
"KGX0601."

491
00:40:16,670 --> 00:40:17,820
I never thought Hatoyama

492
00:40:18,440 --> 00:40:20,970
would use Japanese as test subjects.

493
00:40:21,550 --> 00:40:22,650
That's strange.

494
00:40:23,670 --> 00:40:24,740
The Japanese

495
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:26,870
already captured Unit 401.

496
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:28,650
Why would they risk their own men's lives

497
00:40:28,650 --> 00:40:29,360
for these experiments?

498
00:40:33,110 --> 00:40:33,650
Xiaoyu.

499
00:40:35,190 --> 00:40:36,570
Check every body.

500
00:40:38,630 --> 00:40:39,860
See if you can find any clues

501
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,490
about Hatoyama or Unit 401.

502
00:40:41,630 --> 00:40:42,130
Yes.

503
00:40:56,990 --> 00:40:57,490
Master Zhang,

504
00:40:58,240 --> 00:40:59,610
no bodies from Unit 401 were found.

505
00:41:00,150 --> 00:41:01,380
Hatoyama isn't among them either.

506
00:41:04,030 --> 00:41:05,570
This log lists nearly 100 people.

507
00:41:07,070 --> 00:41:08,050
Besides the Japanese

508
00:41:08,050 --> 00:41:08,900
in Changsha,

509
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:11,260
they must've also sent reinforcements

510
00:41:11,550 --> 00:41:12,340
to Caopan Mountain.

511
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:14,970
Then where did they go?

512
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:18,130
Judging by this place,

513
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:22,130
could they all be dead?

514
00:41:23,150 --> 00:41:23,740
Look.

515
00:41:27,240 --> 00:41:28,900
This log isn't complete.

516
00:41:29,920 --> 00:41:31,820
It ends with just this:

517
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:34,420
"I have attained an immortal body

518
00:41:34,840 --> 00:41:37,260
and become one with this tower.

519
00:41:37,670 --> 00:41:39,380
I am the Otherworld Tower.

520
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:41,450
The Otherworld Tower

521
00:41:42,800 --> 00:41:44,530
is me."

522
00:41:46,280 --> 00:41:47,010
Could

523
00:41:47,630 --> 00:41:48,970
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama have mastered

524
00:41:48,990 --> 00:41:50,260
all the spells,

525
00:41:50,280 --> 00:41:51,300
become an immortal,

526
00:41:52,720 --> 00:41:53,860
and merged

527
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:55,090
with the Otherworld Tower?

528
00:41:56,960 --> 00:41:57,740
Immortal, my foot.

529
00:41:58,590 --> 00:41:59,610
You expect us to believe that?

530
00:42:01,070 --> 00:42:02,530
He's probably hiding somewhere,

531
00:42:02,800 --> 00:42:04,340
waiting to play dirty and scare us.

532
00:42:05,030 --> 00:42:05,900
If even Hatoyama's soldiers

533
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:06,530
are dead,

534
00:42:06,920 --> 00:42:07,700
then Unit 401

535
00:42:07,840 --> 00:42:08,900
may have met the same fate.

536
00:42:10,240 --> 00:42:12,450
We have to find them, dead or alive.

537
00:42:12,990 --> 00:42:13,610
Keep searching.

538
00:42:43,760 --> 00:42:45,380
Such a terrible drawing.

539
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:47,860
You must've drawn it, right?

540
00:42:50,880 --> 00:42:51,610
This dog

541
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,260
was definitely drawn by Laogou.

542
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:53,970
But Master Zhang,

543
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:56,010
Laogou can't remember...

544
00:42:56,150 --> 00:42:56,650
This way.

545
00:44:04,720 --> 00:44:06,450
This place looks freshly grown.

546
00:44:41,780 --> 00:44:45,940
♪The past fades like smoke♪

547
00:44:46,300 --> 00:44:49,020
♪A choice is made in silence♪

548
00:44:49,300 --> 00:44:52,100
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

549
00:44:52,500 --> 00:44:56,260
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

550
00:44:56,500 --> 00:44:59,940
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

551
00:45:00,220 --> 00:45:03,620
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

552
00:45:03,700 --> 00:45:10,980
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

553
00:45:11,420 --> 00:45:14,700
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

554
00:45:14,980 --> 00:45:18,220
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

555
00:45:18,380 --> 00:45:22,420
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

556
00:45:22,620 --> 00:45:25,980
♪Who believes in fate?♪

557
00:45:26,220 --> 00:45:29,580
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

558
00:45:29,820 --> 00:45:33,100
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

559
00:45:33,420 --> 00:45:37,100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

560
00:45:37,300 --> 00:45:40,540
♪Take care♪

561
00:45:40,540 --> 00:45:43,100
♪We once raced♪

562
00:45:43,180 --> 00:45:45,100
♪For the dawn♪

563
00:45:45,260 --> 00:45:48,540
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

564
00:45:48,660 --> 00:45:51,940
♪In the web of fate♪

565
00:45:51,940 --> 00:45:55,140
♪No one can escape♪

566
00:45:56,140 --> 00:45:57,980
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

567
00:45:58,140 --> 00:45:59,700
♪We too were young once♪

568
00:45:59,780 --> 00:46:03,220
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

569
00:46:03,420 --> 00:46:05,740
♪Keep the ember lit♪

570
00:46:05,860 --> 00:46:10,380
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

571
00:46:10,500 --> 00:46:13,460
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

572
00:46:13,700 --> 00:46:17,220
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

573
00:46:17,340 --> 00:46:21,100
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

574
00:46:21,420 --> 00:46:24,900
♪Who believes in fate?♪

575
00:46:25,060 --> 00:46:28,060
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

576
00:46:28,300 --> 00:46:32,060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

577
00:46:32,220 --> 00:46:35,940
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

578
00:46:36,060 --> 00:46:47,500
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
